OL,3,GNEWSAThree towns back proposed law on
OL,4,Acontaminated land
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree town councils have supported a
OL,7,Fproposed law to ensure greater
OL,8,Ftransparency over contaminated land,
OL,9,Fafter North Northamptonshire Council
OL,10,Frejected it in March.
OL,12,FKettering, Corby and Wellingborough
OL,13,Ftown councils have passed motions
OL,14,Fsupporting the principles of Zane's Law
OL,15,Fwhich is named after Zane Gbangbola,
OL,16,Fwhose parents say was killed by gas
OL,17,Ffrom landfill when their home in Surrey
OL,18,Fflooded in 2014.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
