OL,3,GNEWSAThree towns back proposed law on
OL,4,Acontaminated land
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Williams, Green councillor who
OL,7,Fproposed the original motion at North
OL,8,FNorthants Council, called it a
OL,9,F"phenomenal example of solidarity
OL,10,Fbetween our three biggest towns".
OL,12,FNorth Northants said it would consider
OL,13,Fit if it became law, but there could be
OL,14,Ffinancial and other implications for
OL,15,Fcouncils.
